<div class="bp-page">
  <section class="bp-hero"><div class="bp-hero__copy"><p>Architectural metal fabrication</p><h1>Custom curtain wall backpans</h1><div>Fabricated for glazing contractors, architects, consultants, and construction teams—built to suit the opening, installation sequence, insulation requirement, and curtain wall system.</div><div class="bp-actions"><a href="/pages/contact">Request a project quote</a><a href="{{ 'curtain-wall-backpan-brochure.pdf' | asset_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Download brochure</a></div></div><img src="{{ 'backpan-fabricated.png' | asset_url }}" width="870" height="606" alt="Insulated galvanized ProSteel curtain wall backpans staged inside the fabrication facility"></section>
  <section class="bp-intro"><div><p>Built around the project</p><h2>Backpans shaped for the building envelope</h2></div><div><p>Backpans are installed behind opaque curtain wall glazing areas to support insulation and help complete the interior-side assembly. ProSteel fabricates pans to the supplied design, opening dimensions, substrate, and installation requirements.</p><p>Final materials, dimensions, insulation, profiles, fastener details, sealing requirements, and finishes are confirmed for each project.</p></div></section>
  <section class="bp-benefits"><article><h3>Project-specific dimensions</h3><p>Custom sizes, depths, flanges, notches, and formed profiles to suit drawings and field conditions.</p></article><article><h3>Material and insulation options</h3><p>Galvanized steel or aluminum configurations with mineral wool or fiberglass insulation options.</p></article><article><h3>In-house fabrication</h3><p>CNC laser cutting, precision forming, welding, assembly, finishing, and prototyping under one roof.</p></article><article><h3>Installation coordination</h3><p>Factory-installed insulation and structured floor-by-floor or elevation-based shipping are available when specified.</p></article></section>
  <section class="bp-specs"><img src="{{ 'backpan-galvanized.png' | asset_url }}" width="870" height="610" loading="lazy" alt="Finished galvanized ProSteel curtain wall backpans secured on pallets"><div><p>Technical capabilities</p><h2>Configurable to the design criteria</h2><dl><div><dt>Materials</dt><dd>Galvanized G90 steel; aluminum available as a project-specific alternative</dd></div><div><dt>Standard gauges</dt><dd>20 gauge and 22 gauge</dd></div><div><dt>Pan depth</dt><dd>Project-specific increments up to 125 mm (4.92 in)</dd></div><div><dt>Oversized pans</dt><dd>Integrated joint-stiffening design available for pans over 2.3 m² (24.75 sq. ft.)</dd></div><div><dt>Insulation</dt><dd>Mineral wool or fiberglass, with factory-installed insulation available</dd></div><div><dt>Optional finish</dt><dd>Painted or powder-coated exposed surfaces</dd></div></dl></div></section>
  <section class="bp-profiles"><div><p>Formed profiles</p><h2>More than a standard four-sided pan</h2><p>Profile selection depends on the sequence of component installation, glazing method, whether the work is new construction or retrofit, and other project conditions.</p><ul><li>Straight flat section</li><li>Bird beak section</li><li>Box section</li><li>Hat top section</li><li>Adaptor glazing section</li></ul></div><img src="{{ 'backpan-custom-profile.png' | asset_url }}" width="870" height="610" loading="lazy" alt="Custom-profile ProSteel curtain wall backpans stacked in the fabrication shop"></section>
  <section class="bp-process"><header><p>What to send us</p><h2>Start with the project requirements</h2></header><ol><li><span>01</span><strong>Drawings and openings</strong><p>Panel dimensions, elevations, profiles, flanges, penetrations, and tolerances.</p></li><li><span>02</span><strong>Assembly requirements</strong><p>Material, gauge, pan depth, insulation, attachment, substrate, and sealing scope.</p></li><li><span>03</span><strong>Finish and logistics</strong><p>Exposed finish, quantities, packaging, delivery sequence, and required schedule.</p></li></ol></section>
  <section class="bp-cta"><div><p>Have a curtain wall package to price?</p><h2>Send the drawings and project requirements.</h2></div><a href="/pages/contact">Request a quote</a></section>
</div>

